   \[
   \text{Hours for Wednesday} = 2 \times 8.8 = 17.6 \text{ hours}
   \]

Now, sum up all the hours:
\[
\text{Total hours} = 20 + 8.8 + 17.6 = 56.4 \text{ hours}
\]

**Answer:** 
\(\boxed{56.4}\) hours

