S_{n+1} = 2n(a_1 + a_2 + \cdots + a_n + b_1 + b_2 + \cdots + b_n)
\]

We need to determine \( d \):
\[
d = |2n| = 2(n-1)
\]

Thus,
\[
d = 2(n-1)
\]

Therefore, the smallest possible integer \( d \) is:
\[
\boxed{2}
\]<|im_end|>
