\sum_{i=1}^{k} a_{t_i} \leq 2022.
\]

For \( t_i \) from \( 1 \) to \( 2022 \):
\[
\sum_{i=1}^{k} a_{t_i} \leq 2022.
\]

The maximum value here occurs when \( t_i = 1 \), which gives us:
\[
a_{1} + a_{2} + \cdots + a_{2022} = 2022.
\]

Thus, the required \( C \) must be:
