\[
|B| = mn
\]

Given \( |A| = n \), we need to find the smallest possible \( m \). Since \( |B| = mn \) and \( |B| \leq n \):
\[
mn \leq n
\]

The smallest \( m \) that satisfies this condition is:
\[
\boxed{1}
\]<|im_end|>
