\[ \overrightarrow{F_2A} = -\frac{2}{3} \overrightarrow{F_2B} \]
\[ \frac{-2}{3}(a+a) = -\frac{2}{3}(-a) = \frac{2}{3}a \]

Do đó, tâm sai \(S = \frac{2}{3}a\).

