Đặt \( y = \frac{x - \ln(e^x + x)}{x} \):
\[ \lim_{y \to +\infty} (y)^2 = \lim_{y \to +\infty} y^2 = \infty. \]

Hệ quả:
\[ \lim_{x \to +\infty} \sqrt{x^2 + x + 1} \cdot \frac{x - \ln(e^x + x)}{x} = \lim_{y \to +\infty} (y)^2 \cdot \frac{\infty}{\infty} = \infty. \] 

Do đó,
\[ \boxed{\infty}. \]<|im_end|>
