Question: Xét một hàm đồng nhất bậc $4$. $f(x,y,z)=a_1x^4+a_2y^4+a_3z^4+3a_4x^2y^2+3a_5y^2z^2+3a_6x^2z^2$. Tìm $\oiint_{\sum} f(x,y,z)dS$, trong đó $\sum: x^2+y^2+z^2=1$.
Answer: \[ \oint_S f(x,y,z) \, dS = 2\iint_{\Omega} (3a_4 + 3a_5 + 3a_6) \, dx \, dy \]

Với \( \Omega = [0,1] \times [0,1] \):

\[ \Omega = (0,1)^* \times (0,1)^* \]
\[ \Rightarrow \oint_S f(x,y,z) \, dS = 2 \cdot \left( \frac{3}{2}\int_0^{1/2} (3a_4 + 3a_5 + 3a_6) \, dx \right) \cdot \left( \frac{1}{2} \int_0^{1/2} (3a_4 + 3a_5 + 3a_6) \, dy \right) \]

\[ = 2 \cdot \left( \frac{9}{4} \int_0^{1/2} (3a_4 + 3a_5 + 3a_6) \, dx \right) \]

\[ = \frac{9}{4} \cdot \left[ -\frac{1}{2} \int_0^{1/2} (3a_4 + 3a_5 + 3a_6) \, dy \right] \]

\[ = \frac{9}{4} \cdot \left( -\frac{1}{2} \left( \frac{1}{2} (3a_4 + 3a_5 + 3a_6) \right) \right) \]

\[ = \frac{9}{4} \cdot (-\frac{3}{4}) \]

\[ = -\frac{27}{8} \]

Do đó:

\[ \oint_S f(x,y,z) \, dS = \boxed{-\frac{27}{8}} \]<|im_end|>
