Question: Hãy tính tích $$\prod_{n=3}^{\infty} \frac{(n^3+3n)^2}{n^6-64}.$$
Answer: \[ \prod_{n=3}^{\infty} \left( \frac{(n^3 + 3n)^2}{n^6 - 64} \right) = \frac{1}{8} \]

Chứng minh:

\[ \frac{(n^3 + 3n)^2}{n^6 - 64} = \frac{n^9 + 6n^5 + n^2}{n^6 - 64} = \frac{n^{10} - (n^7 + n)}{n^6 - 64} \]

Sử dụng \( \lim_{n \to \infty} \frac{n^n - (n^7 + n)}{n^n - 64} = 1 \):

\[ \prod_{n=3}^{\infty} \left( \frac{n^{10} - (n^7 + n)}{n^6 - 64} \right) = \prod_{n=3}^{\infty} \left( \frac{1}{n^6 - 64} \right) = \boxed{\frac{1}{8}} \]<|im_end|>
